cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its studies, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Quant Research Lab"
abstract: >-
  A Python framework for quantitative financial research, portfolio analytics and
  backtesting, with four reproducible empirical studies and a desktop app. Every analysis is
  a config run by one experiment runner that records its inputs, code version and the number
  of configurations tried.
authors:
